/*
 * PBR / Fresnel – research references (2023–2026)
 * -----------------------------------------------
 * • Belcour et al. SIGGRAPH 2020: "Bringing an Accurate Fresnel to Real-Time Rendering:
 *   a Preintegrable Decomposition" – RGBA LUT for accurate Fresnel; Schlick is an approx.
 * • Ichikawa et al. CVPR 2023: "Fresnel Microfacet BRDF" – unifies surface/body reflection.
 * • EGSR 2025: "Perceived Quality of BRDF Models" – ITP color space correlates with quality.
 * • SIGGRAPH 2025 PBS Course (Weidlich): "Bridging the Gap Between Offline and Real Time
 *   with Neural Materials" – offline vs real-time material fidelity.
 * • 2026: Neural irradiance, Gaussian splatting, SER; PBR core (GGX, Schlick) remains standard.
 */

